<title>AUSTRALIA: Farm sector main risk to Australia growth-Treasury.</title>
<headline>Farm sector main risk to Australia growth-Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasury secretary Ted Evans said on Monday the farm sector was the main downside risk to official forecasts for economic growth.</p>
<p>Asked in a parliamentary committee what he saw as the main downside risk, Evans said: &quot;Probably the farm sector.&quot;</p>
</text>
